#: admin/views/sync/html_admin_sync_shop_profile.php:5
msgid "Sync WooCommerce Customer Billing and Shipping Address with BuddyPress."
msgstr "Synkroniser WooCommerce Kundefaktura og fraktadresse med BuddyPress."

#: admin/views/sync/html_admin_sync_shop_profile.php:8
#| msgid ""
#| "The billing and shipping address fields are WooCommerce default user "
#| "fields. You can sync all default WooCommerce\n"
#| "            customer fields with BuddyPress."
msgid ""
"The billing and shipping address fields are WooCommerce default user fields. "
"You can sync all default WooCommerce customer fields with BuddyPress."
msgstr ""
"Fakturerings- og leveringsadressefeltene er WooCommerce standardbrukerfelt. "
"Du kan synkronisere alle standard WooCommerce kundefelt med BuddyPress."

#: admin/views/sync/html_admin_sync_shop_profile.php:11
msgid ""
"During checkout or if a user edits his profile all fields will be synced "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Under kassen eller hvis en bruker redigerer sin profil, blir alle felt "
"synkronisert automatisk."

#: admin/views/sync/html_admin_sync_shop_profile.php:14
#| msgid ""
#| "If you have already customers and start using WooCommerce BuddyPress "
#| "Integration on an existing store, you need \n"
#| "            to sync your user once."
msgid ""
"If you have already customers and start using WC4BP on an existing store, "
"you need to sync your user once."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du allerede har kunder og begynner å bruke WooCommerce BuddyPress "
"Integration på en eksisterende butikk, må du synkronisere brukeren en gang."

#: admin/views/sync/html_admin_sync_shop_profile.php:17
#| msgid ""
#| "The Customer Billing and Shipping Address fields will be created in "
#| "BuddyPress during the plugin installation,\n"
#| "            but the user sync can take a while depends on the size of "
#| "your user base and needs to be done once after the\n"
#| "            first install."
msgid ""
"The Customer Billing and Shipping Address fields will be created in "
"BuddyPress during the plugin installation, but the user sync can take a "
"while depends on the size of your user base and needs to be done once after "
"the first install."
msgstr ""
"Fakturaene for faktura og fraktadresse vil bli opprettet i BuddyPress under "
"plugin-installasjonen, men brukerens synkronisering kan ta en stund, "
"avhenger av størrelsen på brukerbasen din og må gjøres en gang etter den "
"første installasjonen."

